  "notes": "Tier 2. Researched from public co.my.xcelenergy.com pages (Salesforce site, read in a browser; no sign-in). My Account signs in with the email address used to register (help articles). Card payments are made through KUBRA EZ-Pay without My Account, fee $1.80 per residential payment (support article; an older billing page says $1.50, the newer article is used); bank payments in My Account are free. KUBRA EZ-Pay is modelled as card-only guest pay. Auto Pay draws the bill from a checking or savings account on the due date, needs My Account, is not available with a past-due balance, cannot use a credit card, and starts with the next bill; a mail-in application also exists (not modelled). Phone payments at 800-895-4999. Custom Due Date and Average Monthly Payment exist (not modelled as plans). Start/Stop Service is online. Late fee not read, so none modelled.",
